      "detail": "From checkpoint A1 on branch A to branch B. Reason: Do not touch rows that are not duplicates. Do the dedup stage as a plan first, then migrate only what the plan names. It became rule restart-1 in charter version 3. The conversation was forked at the checkpoint. Branch A was kept.",
